11757	scriptorium	translation	I will make great blessings happen in your shrine in every form, and I will have your companions be called the torch bearers of Christ. Anyone who will keep your commandments, I will grant them to you as children in my kingdom. Anyone who will persevere in the laboring and your ritual will be children to you in the house of my father.”
